     "body": "<p><span class=\"error\">&#91;Comment from Sourceforge Task&#93;</span><br/>\nComment Submitter: rwayland3<br/>\nFixes parser issue so default xml namespaces are now handled correctly. Also fixes undiscovered bug where attribute values were being ignored on root element of in-line xml in BatchModify.</p>\n\n<p>Added an extra example to modify directives file that includes<br/>\nsample xml file from Tufts University that demonstrated original problem.</p>\n\n<p>This addition now is included in junit tests as part of CommandLineUtilitites<br/>\ntesting. Updated modify directives count in junit tests to reflect the new<br/>\nadditions.</p>\n\n<p>Opened a new refactoring feature item:<br/>\n[ 1839529 ] Refactor of BatchModifyParser</p>\n\n<p>to note that it is desirable to bring BatchModifyParser up-to-date with other<br/>\nparsers in codebase for consistency in handling of in-line xml content when time permits.</p>\n\n<p>Committed to maintenance branch (rev 6306)</p>\n\n<p>committed to trunk (rev 6307)</p>",
